# Cells where every engine does the same thing and says it differently.
# Edited BY HAND, and only by hand (GLB-040, decided 2026-09-25): there is
# no command that rewrites it. A split that is not listed is RED (`NEW
# WORDING`), and so is an entry whose cell agrees now or no longer exists
# (`STALE WORDING`) — remove it in the step that healed it. An entry is
# added only with a comment saying who accepted the difference and why.
# This is what zyquality/messages/ counts statically, as it is actually
# emitted.
